      "content": "English: Onesiphorus | French: Onésiphore | Latin: Onesiphor | Origin: &#927;&#957;&#951;&#963;&#953;&#981;&#959;&#961;&#959;&#962; | Vietnamese: Ô-nê-xi-phô-rô -- 2 Tm 1,16 ; 4,19",
